This repository contains the TEAM VROCK website for https://www.vrock.ch.

The site uses `team-vrock/jekyll-theme-vrock@0229d2e8c1bcbfb3b6fd7949d5668126392d4aee` during the refresh work. GitHub project cards are pinned in `_config.yml` and can be enriched into `_data/github_projects.yml` during the GitHub Actions build.
